<title>USA: American HomePatient ups credit facility.</title>
<headline>American HomePatient ups credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, Tenn. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American HomePatient Inc said Wednesday it expanded its bank credit facility to $325.0 million from $225.0 million.</p>
<p>The new facility includes a $150.0 million five-year term loan and a $175.0 million five-year revolving line of credit.</p>
<p>The company said the expanded bank facility provides it with additional financial flexibility and capacity to continue plans for acquisition growth.</p>
</text>
